-start=\"7673\" data-end=\"7708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Central compartment for key item<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7708\" data-end=\"7720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7720\" data-end=\"7735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7735\" data-end=\"7749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mini drawer<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7749\" data-end=\"7767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rings, keepsakes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7768\" data-end=\"7876\">\n<td data-start=\"7768\" data-end=\"7782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Movement type<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7782\" data-end=\"7822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pop-up lift design with aligned folds<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7822\" data-end=\"7835\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Paperboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7835\" data-end=\"7845\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV coat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7845\" data-end=\"7858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pop strips<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7858\" data-end=\"7876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Surprise reveals<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7877\" data-end=\"7999\">\n<td data-start=\"7877\" data-end=\"7891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Theme options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7891\" data-end=\"7927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Styles for parties and milestones<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7927\" data-end=\"7949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, coated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7949\" data-end=\"7959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PMS ink<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7959\" data-end=\"7978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Decorative print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7978\" data-end=\"7999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Celebration gifting<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cardboard Pop Up Gift Boxes add a playful, story-driven reveal that turns simple gifts into memorable moments. Many brands and DIY creators source design-friendly options from <strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"270\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong>\u00a0when they want sturdy structures with smooth rising layers. These 